# Docker sends the whole build context to the daemon before the first
# instruction runs. .gitignore has no effect on that — this file does.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The FiveK dataset is roughly 50 GB. Without this line every image build would
# start by copying it. This is the one entry that must never be removed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/

# Secrets never enter an image; configuration arrives as environment variables.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output and dependencies — restored inside the image, not copied in.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Working documents and research scripts are not part of any deliverable.
docs/
sandbox/
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md
.claude/
